We need to find two adjacent subarrays of length k, both strictly increasing. So we need an index a such that nums[a..a+k-1] is strictly increasing and nums[a+k..a+2k-1] is strictly increasing. Equivalently, nums[a..a+2k-1] is such that both halves are strictly increasing (note: the whole 2k window being strictly increasing is sufficient but not necessary — actually wait, if nums[a..a+k-1] is strictly increasing and nums[a+k..a+2k-1] is strictly increasing, we don't need nums[a+k-1] < nums[a+k]. So the combined window need not be fully increasing).

